<title>UK: BayerLB to launch $1.0 billion 10-year global bond.</title>
<headline>BayerLB to launch $1.0 billion 10-year global bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-06-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Bayerische Landesbank Girozentrale will shortly launch a $1.0 billion 10-year global bond through its New York branch, Merrill Lynch and J.P. Morgan said as joint lead managers.</p>
<p>BayerLb is rated AAA by Moodys, S&amp;P and IBCA.</p>
<p>No other details were made available.</p>
<p>-- London newsroom +44 171 542 8863</p>
